      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Summarizes Table 2's comparison between FORML4 and existing autoformalization datasets, highlighting that FORML4 pairs statements with proofs via human-verified LLM informalization and supports automated process-driven training from Lean 4 compiler feedback across diverse mathematical complexities.",
