        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Outlines the Process-Driven Autoformalization (PDA) methodology, starting from a baseline LLM fine-tuned on FORML4, introducing a Process-Supervised Verifier (PSV) trained on Lean 4 compiler feedback, and establishing an iterative improvement loop.",
